# MedSync Health, Inc.
# Annual Financial Report - Fiscal Year 2025

## Executive Summary

Fiscal Year 2025 was a year of exceptional growth for MedSync Health, driven by strong market adoption of our flagship MedSync Platform and successful expansion into the European market. Revenue grew by 60% year-over-year, reaching $80 million, while we maintained healthy profitability and continued to invest in product innovation and market expansion.

