## Financial Analysis

Revenue growth from FY 2023 to FY 2024 was a solid 25%, accelerating to 60% in FY 2025. This acceleration was primarily due to the successful launch of our AI-powered discharge planning module and the signing of three major health systems in the US and UK.

Gross margins have consistently improved, from 65% in FY 2023 to 70% in FY 2025, reflecting economies of scale and improved efficiency in our cloud infrastructure.

Net income has more than doubled from $12.0M in FY 2023 to $32.0M in FY 2025, demonstrating our ability to scale the business profitably.
